    "head_commit_message": "perf(native): sum parting's pushes per body on the pool, in pair order\n\nEach pass's pushes become keys (body, pair, side), sorted on the pool, so\neach body's pushes run together in pair order. Each body's run is summed\nfrom zero on the pool and the bodies are moved in the order the serial\npass first meets them, so outcomes are bit for bit the same. Coincident\npairs still ask the seeded way on this thread, in pair order. The\none-thread path keeps the serial sums.\n\nRefs #557\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4zcfHZcGHMi4aC5yB",
